# OpenAMRobot v2.0.0-rc.1: Baseline 1 INTEGRATION SNAPSHOT, heads read 2026-11-20 19:00 UTC.
# NOT release content. These are integration branches that are never merged
# (platform-sw PR #161, upperbody-sw PR #77, both "do not merge"). The release
# pins are manifests/v2.0.0-rc.1.repos at the repository root.
# A snapshot is development evidence, not a reviewed pin. Each simulation run in
# RELEASE_NOTES.md names the commits it ran on; those are older than these heads,
# and no run has executed on these heads yet. Refreshed on publication day
# (RUNBOOK.md, step 8); with a qualifying strict run it records that run's pins.
